# v1.44.2 R-Mac-1 — placeholder so the public/ directory exists in
# git, so the Dockerfile multi-stage COPY succeeds.
#
# Codex's Mac validation of PR #151 caught:
#   COPY --from=build /app/public ./public
# failing in Dockerfile:36 because console-next/public/ wasn't on
# disk. Without the directory the docker build aborts → omega_console_next
# never starts → smoke 0/34.
#
# Next.js convention: public/ holds untouched-by-the-bundler static
# assets (favicon, robots.txt, OG images). Empty for now; team can
# drop favicon.ico / favicon.svg here without code changes.
